From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton Palgunov <toxblh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:25:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 46/99] v8: e2k: test bits and branch with one compare

A branch on `x & mask` was `and` into a scratch register and a branch on
the result: two operations one after the other. cmpandedb compares the
conjunction with zero by itself. New layer instructions bteqz/btnez (and
bteqzi/btnezi with a constant mask), MacroAssembler::BranchTst, used for
kE2kTst branches, deoptimization checks included.
